      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这不符合她的作风，她是会正确掌握事实的人。\n虽然不一定要感谢粉丝的心意，\n但我希望她至少能听听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19edbdb515493c36092ad0145595db24cfed8c84e7348ec84e13b4b59452e68f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
